{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56125","headline":"步虚词 十八 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"始青黎元盖，金香结珠烟。\n飞晨总翘辔，稽首玉帝前。\n帝心浩以舒，锡吾《太灵篇》。\n是谓不灭道，万天秉吾权。\n吾行空洞中，下仙昩其渊。\n（同前卷三十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}